This release extracts mainline EEG-Captioner research code and adds packaging,
portable manifests, CLI entry points, and independent split evaluation.
See docs/source_provenance.json for source hashes and extracted symbols.

Retained generated caption text is included separately under annotations/;
see its provenance and historical-snapshot limitations. No EEG recordings
or EEG tensors are included.

Qwen model weights, TUEG recordings, and MNE template/atlas assets are not covered by
this repository's MIT license and are not included in the source release.
Their upstream terms continue to apply. CBraMod/LaBraM code and weights are
not included or required by this mainline release.
